<ServiceHero
  section="services"
  slug="freezer-repair/ice-buildup"
  eyebrow="Ice & Frost Buildup · Freezer Diagnostic Guide · Same Day Southern California"
  title="Ice Buildup in Your Freezer? Here's Why It Keeps Coming Back"
  subtitle="On a frost-free freezer, a growing sheet of ice means the defrost system has failed — or the door seal is leaking. Here's how to tell the difference, clear it, and know when it's a tech job."
  heroImageTitle="Freezer Ice Buildup Repair"
